Carmen Cruickshank: Yeah.

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:09.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Cause these, like…

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:13.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Uh, yeah, like, absolutely nothing.

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:20.000
Carmen Cruickshank: These only had 10 keywords or 10 searches per month in that small area.

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:21.000
Carmen Cruickshank: So…

