00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:47.000
Carmen Cruickshank: It's kind of frustrating when it's like that, because it's, like, such a small area, and then not a lot of people are.

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:48.000
Fallon Looney: I know.

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:49.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Only so much I can do.

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:51.000
Fallon Looney: I know.

00:04:50.000 --> 00:05:00.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Yeah. Other than that, though, like I'm glad her main focus is doing pretty good. Let's see. OK, Brook Lake.

